          "AUTH must follow EHLO (not HELO) and must precede MAIL FROM.",
          "STARTTLS must follow EHLO and precede AUTH or MAIL.",
          "RSET can be issued at any time during a mail transaction (MAIL_PENDING, RCPT_PENDING) and resets state to GREETED.",
          "After DATA completes (message sent), a new transaction can begin with MAIL FROM, or the session can end with QUIT.",
          "QUIT terminates the session and must be followed by server response 221.",
          "NOOP and VRFY can be issued at any time after greeting without affecting transaction state."
